<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- SPIN Overview -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-blue-200">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">The SPIN Methodology</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
      SPIN Selling is designed for complex B2B sales. Instead of pitching, you ask four types of questions that lead buyers to recognize they need your solution.
    </p>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600"><strong>Key principle:</strong> People buy when they feel the pain is urgent and your solution is the answer. SPIN questions make that happen.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The Four Question Types -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

    <!-- Situation Questions -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-green-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-500 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mr-3">S</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Situation Questions</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Gather context about their current setup. Keep these brief—too many and you sound like a survey.</p>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"What's your current process for [task]?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"How many people are on your team?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"Which tools are you using today?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"Who's responsible for [specific area]?"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
        <p class="text-xs text-amber-800"><strong>⚠️ Warning:</strong> Limit to 3-4 questions. Move to Problem questions quickly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Problem Questions -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-red-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mr-3">P</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Problem Questions</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Uncover difficulties, pain points, and dissatisfactions with their current approach.</p>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"What's frustrating about your current solution?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"Where do bottlenecks show up in your workflow?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"What happens when things go wrong?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"Is [specific problem] something you deal with often?"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-200">
        <p class="text-xs text-green-800"><strong>✅ Pro Tip:</strong> Listen for pain. When they complain, dig deeper with follow-ups.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Implication Questions -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-orange-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mr-3">I</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Implication Questions</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Make the problem feel bigger and more urgent. Connect pain to business impact.</p>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"How does that affect your team's productivity?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"What does that cost you in revenue?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"If this continues, what happens in 6 months?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"Does that create problems for other departments too?"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200">
        <p class="text-xs text-blue-800"><strong>💡 Goal:</strong> Get them to say "This is a bigger problem than I realized."</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Need-Payoff Questions -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-purple-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mr-3">N</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Need-Payoff Questions</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Get them to articulate the benefits of solving the problem. Let THEM sell it to themselves.</p>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="bg-purple-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"If you could solve this, how would that help your team?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-purple-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"What would it be worth to you to eliminate [problem]?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-purple-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"How would faster [outcome] impact your business?"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-purple-50 rounded-lg p-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">"Would automating this free up time for more strategic work?"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-200">
        <p class="text-xs text-green-800"><strong>🎯 Perfect:</strong> When they say "Yeah, that would be huge for us!"—now you can pitch.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Discovery Call Script -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Discovery Call Script (30 min)</h3>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-gray-400 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Opening (2 min)</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">"Thanks for taking the time. I'd love to learn more about [their company] and see if there's a fit. I'll ask some questions about your current setup and challenges. Sound good?"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Situation (5 min)</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">Get context. Ask 3-4 Situation questions to understand their world.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">Example flow: Current process → Team size → Tools used → Decision makers</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Problem (8 min)</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">Dig into pain. Ask Problem questions and listen carefully. Follow up when you hear frustration.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Tell me more about that..." "How often does that happen?" "What have you tried?"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-orange-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Implication (7 min)</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">Make it urgent. Connect problems to business impact. Get them to feel the cost of inaction.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"What's that costing you?" "How does that affect other teams?" "What if this isn't fixed?"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Need-Payoff (6 min)</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">Let them sell themselves. Ask about benefits of solving the problem. They should be excited by now.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"If we could solve this, what would that mean for you?" "How would that change things?"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Transition to Demo (2 min)</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2">NOW you can pitch. Frame your solution around THEIR words.</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Based on what you've shared, let me show you how we solve exactly that problem..."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Common Mistakes -->
  <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-red-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">Common SPIN Mistakes</h3>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-red-600 font-bold">❌</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Pitching too early before understanding their pain</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-red-600 font-bold">❌</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Asking too many Situation questions (feels like an interrogation)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-red-600 font-bold">❌</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Not listening—just waiting for your turn to talk</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-red-600 font-bold">❌</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Skipping Need-Payoff questions (you end up selling, not them)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-red-600 font-bold">❌</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Reading from a script instead of having a conversation</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
